4. Test fixtures and reference implementations

   The test suite encodes its own Ogg Opus fixtures with MiniOpus's own muxer.
   Where the suite cross-checks against a reference, it links against
   opusfile (Copyright 2012-2026 Xiph.Org Foundation, BSD-3-Clause) when
